<title>GERMANY: Kloeckner 96/97 pre-tax profit near 200 mln.</title>
<headline>Kloeckner 96/97 pre-tax profit near 200 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DUISBERG, Germany 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>German machinery maker Kloeckner Werke AG said on Wednesday that pre-tax profits in the year to the end of March 1997 were around 200 million marks.</p>
<p>The group said that sales in 1996/97 were around 4.2 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
